"end":185.82},{"word":" From","start":185.82,"end":185.96},{"word":" booking","start":185.96,"end":186.18},{"word":" the","start":186.18,"end":186.36},{"word":" reservation","start":186.36,"end":186.82},{"word":" to","start":186.82,"end":187.14},{"word":" understanding","start":187.14,"end":187.64},{"word":" the","start":187.64,"end":187.84},{"word":" airport","start":187.84,"end":188.2},{"word":" pick","start":188.2,"end":188.42},{"word":" up.","start":188.42,"end":188.62},{"word":" Gathering","start":188.62,"end":188.84},{"word":" the","start":188.84,"end":188.94},{"word":" right","start":188.94,"end":189.1},{"word":" details.","start":189.1,"end":189.66},{"word":" Want","start":189.66,"end":189.7},{"word":" to","start":189.7,"end":189.78},{"word":" see","start":189.78,"end":189.96},{"word":" vConcierge","start":189.96,"end":190.84},{"word":" in","start":190.84,"end":190.98},{"word":" action?","start":190.98,"end":191.54},{"word":" Visit","start":191.54,"end":192.08},{"word":" us","start":192.08,"end":192.3},{"word":" at","start":192.3,"end":192.44},{"word":" booth","start":192.44,"end":192.64},{"word":" 512","start":192.64,"end":193.3},{"word":" at","start":193.3,"end":193.62},{"word":" IHS","start":193.62,"end":194.16},{"word":" Miami.","start":194.16,"end":194.98},{"word":" We'd","start":194.98,"end":195.46},{"word":" love","start":195.46,"end":195.6},{"word":" to","start":195.6,"end":195.78},{"word":" meet","start":195.78,"end":195.94},{"word":" you.","start":195.94,"end":196.54}],"request_id":"4e0f1461-315e-48c6-b1ea-742127c24188","text":"Hello, how may I help you? From reservations and dining to concierge services and requests. Can you arrange an airport transfer? V takes care of it. Let's see how Vee handles a call and helps a guest reserve a room. Welcome to the Demo Heritage Hotel. How may I assist you today? Hi, I wanted to book a hotel room. Awesome, I can help you with that. Let's start with the basics. What date would you like to check in and what date would you be checking out? I will be checking in on the 1st October and checkout will be on 5th of October. The both will be around 2 p.m. Got it. Check in on the 1st of October and check out on the 5th. Both around 2 p.m. Just a heads up. Our standard check-in time is 3 p.m. and check-out is 12 p.m., but we can definitely accommodate the 2 p.m. times. I'll make a note of that. Now, how many guests will be staying with you? Three guests will be in total. Three guests. Got it. Just so our standard rooms can accommodate up to three guests so you should be all set. Now, what type of room would you prefer? We have single bed, double bed, or adjoining rooms. I'd prefer having a room with double bed and another with single bed. I think I may have misheard you there. Did you say room with a double bed? and another with a single bed. So that would be two rooms total. Yeah, that's correct. So to recap, you'd like two rooms for three guests total, checking in on the 1st of October and checking out on the 5th, both around 2 p.m., one room with a double bed and one with a single bed. Just to confirm, that's two separate rooms, correct? And do you have any other questions? I'd like to arrange an airport pickup for 1 p.m. Please share your flight details and passenger count. Skyline Airways SX234 arriving at 12.45pm, 3 passengers. Got it. How much luggage will you have? 2 cabin bags and 2 suitcases. Perfect. Your 1pm airport pickup is arranged. Thank you. Let's see what happens after the call as our voice agent connects with Muse from understanding the guest's request to creating and managing the final reservation. Muse gives hotel teams a clear overview of their reservations and performance in one place. Teams can quickly monitor total reservations, room nights, guest volume, reservation status, and booking segments. From the timeline, staff can see room availability and reservations at a glance. Selecting a guest provides instant access to stay dates, room details, guest information, payment details, and check-in actions. Creating a new reservation is simple. Staff can select the required dates, rooms, and guests, view available room types and rates, and choose the best option for the guest. All from one streamlined workflow. What you just saw was vConcierge handling a complete multi-step guest request. From booking the reservation to understanding the airport pick up. Gathering the right details. Want to see vConcierge in action? Visit us at booth 512 at IHS Miami. We'd love to meet you."}
